From: William Emerison Six <billsix@gmail.com>
Date: Mon, 7 Sep 2026 21:30:47 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 0961/3799] soh: rename D_808994F0 -> sPillarDebrisLifetimes

Name source: DEDUCED from the code (confidence HIGH) -- zeldaret/oot
leaves this symbol address-named too, so there is no upstream name to adopt.
Reason: feeds the life parameter (13th argument) of EffectSsKakera_Spawn in the pillar debris burst, alongside sPillarDebrisScales.
Defined in soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Jya_Ironobj/z_bg_jya_ironobj.c.

Tagged [LLM:HIGH] at the definition, every declaration and every call site, so a
reader meeting the name anywhere knows it is inferred.
---
 .../overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Jya_Ironobj/z_bg_jya_ironobj.c    | 5 +++--
 1 file changed, 3 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Jya_Ironobj/z_bg_jya_ironobj.c b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Jya_Ironobj/z_bg_jya_ironobj.c
index 8a5bc5ae4..2605e34ab 100644
--- a/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Jya_Ironobj/z_bg_jya_ironobj.c
+++ b/soh/src/overlays/actors/ovl_Bg_Jya_Ironobj/z_bg_jya_ironobj.c
@@ -67,7 +67,8 @@ static s16 sDebrisYawOffsets[] = { 0x8700, 0x4000, 0xC000, 0x0000 };  // was D_8
 // Pillar
 // LLM generated name (HIGH), was D_808994E0: feeds the scale parameter of EffectSsKakera_Spawn in BgJyaIronobj_SpawnPillarParticles (10th argument); the in-tree comment already groups it under "// Pillar".
 static s16 sPillarDebrisScales[] = { 5, 8, 11, 14, 17, 20, 23, 26 };  // was D_808994E0 [LLM:HIGH]
-static s16 D_808994F0[] = { 18, 26, 34, 42, 50, 60, 70, 80 };
+// LLM generated name (HIGH), was D_808994F0: feeds the life parameter (13th argument) of EffectSsKakera_Spawn in the pillar debris burst, alongside sPillarDebrisScales.
+static s16 sPillarDebrisLifetimes[] = { 18, 26, 34, 42, 50, 60, 70, 80 };  // was D_808994F0 [LLM:HIGH]
 static s16 D_80899500[] = { 48, 42, 36, 32, 28, 24, 20, 16 };
 
 // Throne
@@ -153,7 +154,7 @@ void BgJyaIronobj_SpawnPillarParticles(BgJyaIronobj* this, PlayState* play, EnIk
         vel.y = (Rand_ZeroOne() * 8.0f) - 3.0f;
         vel.z = 2.0f * ((Rand_ZeroOne() * 6.0f) - 3.0f) + (Rand_ZeroOne() * coss * 8.0f * temp_f22);
         EffectSsKakera_Spawn(play, &pos, &vel, &pos, -350, unkArg5, D_80899500[j & 7], 4, 0, sPillarDebrisScales[j & 7], 0, 5,  // was D_808994E0 [LLM:HIGH]
-                             D_808994F0[j & 7], -1, OBJECT_JYA_IRON, gObjectJyaIronDL_000880);
+                             sPillarDebrisLifetimes[j & 7], -1, OBJECT_JYA_IRON, gObjectJyaIronDL_000880);  // was D_808994F0 [LLM:HIGH]
         if (Rand_ZeroOne() < 0.26f) {
             func_80033480(play, &pos, 200.0f, 1, sPillarDebrisScales[j & 7] * 4 + 60, sPillarDebrisScales[j & 7] * 4 + 80, 1);  // was D_808994E0 [LLM:HIGH]
         }
